• For Field_9, keep Drone_63, Drone_115, Drone_116, Drone_169 and Drone_207 as “protecting Field_9.”

Step 4 – Choose the additional drones (from those moving to the field) that are “closest” to the field centers:
• Field_2 (rectangle roughly (31,24)–(47,39), center ≈(39,31.5)):
